  "necessity": "Supported manual physical route and between-vector retirement preserve the same learned BANK/ENV completed-parent correlation, physical-count-backed content and existing independent synthetic schedule; existing POP cannot supply those jointly without added effects or false ownership. No separate outcome-import subsystem is justified.",
  "required_implementation_proofs": [
    "Current issued session/accepted/activation/participation and generation validation, conflicting binding refusal, unforgeable noncopyable capabilities, exact ownership and owned result copies.",
    "A-only entry through genuine initial participation; B actual count4 before A-only fifth physical step; no fifth B effect/admission; exactly-once terminal cancellation.",
    "One complete physical/DAC step and zero BANK/runtime/Q/replay service; separate original synthetic BANK event exactly once with independent sparse ticks/masks and unchanged geometry.",
    "Full local role-owned canonical completion, actual same BANK dispositions, real ENV close/release and strict initial/completed restore; old history cannot authorize receiving live close.",
    "Original exception identity, stage-based fail-closed cleanup, no earned effect retry, cleanup notes, and no blanket unrelated BANK/native quarantine.",
    "Ordinary integrated reward path remains equivalent after shared factoring; every physical helper effect retained.",
    "Whole-source packet caps and no implicit helper expansion; full original matrices and gate remain required."
  ],
  "later_required_gate": "Full ENV source-complete RNG/device inventory and genuine invocation-completion consumer/health integration remain explicit later shared C2 gate; bounded CPU execution must not be marketed as that proof.",
